Z||000003||Gary W||11-02-2001||11:25 PM||||If this happened suddenly, I would suspect a timing or fuel problem. Wouldn't hurt to check the front plugs if they're older. If you have a test light, check one fuel injector on each bank. One whole side can fail, so you are running on 3 cyl.||||reg||1
